# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset protection — DEAP and other EEG/physiological datasets
# The DEAP dataset must NEVER be committed to this repository.
# Researchers supply it locally via the DEAP_DATA_DIR environment variable.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dat
*.mat
*.edf
*.fdt
*.set
*.bdf
*.cnt
*.vhdr
*.vmrk

# Common local dataset directory names
# NOTE: anchored with leading slash so only ROOT-level directories are excluded.
# This prevents backend/snn_ai_optimizer/datasets/ Python module from being hidden.
/data/
/Datasets/
/datasets/
/DEAP/
/deap/
/raw_data/
